# 🌍 AirGuard AI

### Real-Time Air Quality Monitoring & Environmental Intelligence Dashboard

AirGuard AI is a web-based environmental intelligence dashboard designed to monitor air quality, analyze pollution levels, and provide location-based air quality insights.

## 🎯 Purpose
AirGuard AI is designed to make air-quality information easy to understand by providing real-time AQI monitoring, location-based air-quality data, pollution risk assessment, interactive maps, and early warnings through a single dashboard.

