🚀 Open AirGuard AI Live Demo -  https://airguard-ai-ldll.onrender.com

## 🚀 Features

- 📊 Real-time AQI monitoring
- 📍 Current location-based air quality
- 🗺️ Interactive air quality map
- 🔵 Multiple monitoring stations
- 🌫️ PM2.5 and PM10 monitoring
- ⚠️ Pollution risk assessment
- 🚨 Early warning insights
- 📈 AQI forecasting dashboard
- 🤖 AI-powered environmental insights
- 🔄 Live data refresh

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5
